# Cricket "Chucking" Detector — Implementation Plan

## Goal
Build a single-file Python prototype (`prototype.py`) that analyzes bowling action video to detect illegal "chucking" per the ICC 15° elbow extension rule, using **MediaPipe Pose Landmarker** for 3D joint tracking on CPU.

